:: Seaspray Hotel Sneak Terrace
<<effects>>

<<if $willpowerSuccess>>
	It's not a wide gap, but crossing it over such a drop is still scary. You resist looking down, <span class="green">and make it across.</span>
	<br><br>
	The terrace door to this room is closed, but unlocked. There's no front door, other than the one you used, and there's only one room. There is a ladder however, leading to a ventilation shaft in the ceiling.
	<br><br>
	Two stacks of computer servers are the only furniture, aside from a stool. They sit behind screens of glass, blinking with blue lights.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel Sneak Terrace 2]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<<else>>
	You look down, at the pavement far below. Was the gap always this wide? You put one foot on the railing, <span class="red">and a sudden terror grips you.</span> You flee the room.<<gstress>><<stress 6>><<gwillpower>><<willpower 1>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>


:: Seaspray Hotel Sneak Terrace 2
<<effects>>

You climb the ladder, and look up and down a vent. It's wide enough for you to squeeze through. One direction leads to a dead-end, but the other slopes down, and disappears around a bend. It's wide enough to squeeze through.
<br><br>

<<link [[Explore (0:10)|Seaspray Hotel Sneak Terrace Explore]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Seaspray Hotel Sneak Terrace Explore
<<effects>>
<<set $hotelVents to 1>>
You crawl through the vents. They turn this way and that, passing above rooms and letting you peek inside through thin slits. Some are occupied, but you pass by unbeknownst.
<br><br>

There are no other entrances however, until you at last arrive at the bottom of a laundry room. You crawl from the vent, and peek outside. It's a normal corridor. You soon get your bearings.
<br><br>


<<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><</link>>
<br>


:: Seaspray Hotel Sneak Wallet
<<effects>>

The <<person>> turns as you swipe the <<wallet>> from the table. <<He>> jumps in fright, almost dropping the phone, then furiously dials a number. You turn and run.
<br><br>
"Police!" the <<person>> says behind you. "I'm being robbed!"
<br><br>
You escape the room while the occupant shouts into <<his>> phone.
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>


:: Seaspray Hotel Manager
<<effects>>

<<loadNPC 0 "hotel_manager">><<person1>>
You enter the manager's office, and find <<him>> sat at <<his>> desk. <<He>> looks up.
<br><br>
"Ahh, look who's back."
<br><br>

<<link [[Leave|Seaspray Hotel]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
