:: Seaspray Hotel Manager Intro
<<effects>><<person1>>

<<if $phase is 1>>
    You shake the <<persons>> hand.
<<else>>
    You keep your hands at your side. The <<person>> takes it in stride.
<</if>>
<br><br>

"Say, what's a student like you doing in a place like this?" <<he>> asks. "But who am I to judge? You must have your reasons. Have a seat, if you don't mind." <<He>> gestures towards the chair by the desk.
<br><br>
"Straight to the point, I have a proposal for you." <<He>> turns to the computer. "It's going to be worth your while." The <<person>> opens several recordings showing you causing trouble around the hotel.
<br><br>

You stare at the recordings. You don't remember seeing any cameras nearby. "I..."
<br><br>

The <<person>> raises a hand before you can continue. "You're making my customers unhappy," <<he>> says with a polite smile. "I'm going to offer you a job to make up for the losses."
<br><br>
The <<person>> stands and walks towards you. "Just keep doing what you're doing now." <<He>> keeps the same polite smile. <span class='lewd'>"I've enjoyed watching what happens around here. No one else has given me this much entertainment."</span>
<br><br>
<span class='red'>You're visibly confused.</span> 
<br><br>

<<link [[Agree|Seaspray Hotel Manager Nod]]>><<set $hotelManagerReply to 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Don't agree|Seaspray Hotel Manager Nod]]>><<set $hotelManagerReply to 0>><</link>>
<br>


